<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-BANGLADESH WIN ICC TROPHY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BANGLADESH WIN ICC TROPHY.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh beat Kenya to win the International Cricket Council (ICC) Trophy on Sunday.</p>
<p>Bangladesh, set a revised target of 166 in 25 overs in the rain-affected match, scored the winning run off the last ball of the match.</p>
<p>Scores: Kenya 241-7 in 50 overs (innings closed); Bangladesh 166-8 in 25 overs.</p>
</text>
